# Upstream API origin. Used server-side (RSC, route handlers) and by the
# /api/gateway BFF. Never exposed to the browser: the client only ever calls
# this app's own origin, which is what keeps the auth cookie first-party.
MOA_API_URL=https://api.myotherapp.in

# Razorpay's public key id (rzp_live_… or rzp_test_…) for the checkout that
# opens in the page on Plan & billing. Public by design: it names the account
# and cannot charge anything. Left empty, the page hands the club Razorpay's
# hosted checkout link instead. Never put the key *secret* here.
NEXT_PUBLIC_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
